---
title: "Prarthonad"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "Dm"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

[Dm]amaar e jeebon taa

[Gm]ke aami

[Dm]bujhte pereo bu

[Gm]jhe uthini

[Bb]aami ki [F]tomaar

tu [Gm]leer achor shudhu

[Bb]tomaar [F]ronger

[Gm]khoraak shudhu

[Dm]aar [C]laal ronger

[F]tulee te [Gm]rangio na

tumi [Dm]amaar jibon

amaar aka [C]shopno gulo

[F]chhire phele

[Gm]duhshopno tumi

[Dm]aar eko na

chai na [Bb]ghreena

[C]korte [Dm]tomaake

[F]chai shudhu [Gm]tomaake

[F]prarthonae

[F]chai shudhu [Gm]tomaake

[F]artonad

[Gm]aa [F]aa [Gm]aa [F]aa aa

[Gm]aa [C]aa [Dm]aami
